                  <div class="gap-32 flex-v">
                    <div wb-split-type="words" wb-component="split-text" wb-duration="0.2" class="text-24 center">We all love the quality of your work and would be super keen to partner again with you on more videos in the future.</div>
                    <div wb-interval-delay="0.1" wb-component="smart-animate" class="w-layout-hflex flex-h _16 center"><img src="/images/testimonial-avatar.avif" loading="eager" width="48" height="48" alt="" srcset="/images/testimonial-avatar-p-500.avif 500w, /images/testimonial-avatar.avif 800w" sizes="48px" class="testimonial-profile">
