                        <div class="line-gradient-2 static small _80"></div>
                        <div class="text-20-150 testimonial-role">Lead Brand Deisgner</div><img src="/images/logoMirakl.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="img-100 h-100 no-rounded">
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div wb-component="smart-animate" class="text-16-150 color-white-80 align-center-typo">What started as a single project quickly evolved into a <strong>long-term partnership with Mirakl.</strong> Our role grew from creating standout videos to <strong>becoming their 360 creative partner,</strong> providing marketing event support, developing branding across four global events, editing client testimonial and event recap videos, producing product launches and explainer content, and designing new Lottie animations for their website.</div>
