                  <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80">Many projects were tied to event launches, and Mirakl didn’t provide UI screens. Working under tight deadlines across multiple events, we collaborated closely with their product team to create mock-up UI assets that closely matched the products still in development, while keeping everything stylized, clear, and on-brand.</div>
